# Grafana dashboards

## Defaults

1. Search before creating a near-duplicate dashboard title.
2. Prefer updating a named dashboard over minting a new one.
3. Never invent dashboard or folder UIDs — resolve via search/get.
4. Panel image / snapshot only when the user asked for a visual.
